sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant KServe as KServe Control Plane
    participant OVMS as OVMS Container<br/>/ovms/bin/ovms
    participant Storage as Model Storage<br/>/mnt/models
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over KServe,OVMS: Deployment Phase
    KServe->>OVMS: Create InferenceService Pod<br/>via ServingRuntime CRD
    KServe->>Storage: Mount model volume<br/>at /mnt/models
    OVMS->>Storage: Load model artifacts<br/>Filesystem I/O

    Note over Client,OVMS: Flow 1: Direct Model Inference
    Client->>OVMS: POST /v2/models/{model}/infer<br/>8080/TCP HTTP/1.1<br/>No built-in auth (platform-delegated)
    OVMS-->>Client: JSON Inference Response

    Client->>OVMS: gRPC Predict Request<br/>9000/TCP HTTP/2<br/>No built-in auth (platform-delegated)
    OVMS-->>Client: gRPC Inference Response

    Client->>OVMS: GET /v2/health/ready<br/>8080/TCP HTTP/1.1
    OVMS-->>Client: 200 OK (Ready)

    Note over Client,OVMS: Flow 2: mTLS Sidecar Inference (Optional)
    participant Nginx as nginx Proxy<br/>TLSv1.2 mTLS

    Client->>Nginx: HTTPS Request<br/>Configured/TCP TLSv1.2<br/>mTLS client certificate
    Nginx->>OVMS: HTTP Forward<br/>localhost (plaintext)
    OVMS-->>Nginx: Response
    Nginx-->>Client: HTTPS Response

    Client->>Nginx: gRPC Request<br/>Configured/TCP TLSv1.2<br/>mTLS client certificate
    Nginx->>OVMS: gRPC Forward<br/>localhost (plaintext)
    OVMS-->>Nginx: gRPC Response
    Nginx-->>Client: gRPC Response (TLS)

    Note over Prom,OVMS: Metrics Collection
    Prom->>OVMS: GET /metrics<br/>8080/TCP HTTP/1.1
    OVMS-->>Prom: Prometheus Metrics
